  </div>
  <div class="container mt-4">
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-md-4"><div class="biz-grid-card"><div class="ico"><i class="fas fa-comment-dots"></i></div><h5>Sarah — SMS &amp; Messenger</h5><p>Auto-replies to texts and FB Messenger with live availability, pricing, and booking links. Same AI, both channels.</p></div></div>
      <div class="col-md-4"><div class="biz-grid-card"><div class="ico"><i class="fas fa-phone-volume"></i></div><h5>Voice AI receptionist</h5><p>Answers the phone 24/7, screens spam/robocalls, books or transfers, and posts a summary + recording to Slack.</p></div></div>
      <div class="col-md-4"><div class="biz-grid-card"><div class="ico"><i class="fab fa-slack"></i></div><h5>Slack HQ</h5><p>New bookings, calls, and payments land in Slack in real time &mdash; the team runs the day from one channel.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

