      <p style="opacity:.85;margin-bottom:6px">Built &amp; operated by</p>
      <h3 style="font-weight:800;margin:0">Nehemiah Reese &mdash; Bird Herd Media</h3>
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-light btn-lg fw-bold mt-4" style="color:#004E89"><i class="fas fa-globe me-2"></i>Explore the live site</a>
